DexBaileys
Maintained by Shyam Chaudhari (DEX SHYAM TECH).

DexBaileys is based on Baileys by Rajeh Taher / WhiskeySockets
(https://github.com/WhiskeySockets/Baileys, MIT), taken at commit bb0a87e.

It also includes selected MIT-licensed changes from RedxBaileys by
Abdul Rehman Rajpoot (https://github.com/AbdulRehman19721986/RedxBaileys,
commit 037e37d), which itself credits StableBail by Team Qadeer
(https://github.com/Qadeer-Xtech/stablebail).

v1.1 adapts, rewritten in TypeScript, the interactive message
(buttons / list / native flow / carousel) approach of itsliaaa/baileys
(https://github.com/itsliaaa/baileys, commit b07993d) and the reconnect and
pairing fixes of chaeulso/baileys
(https://github.com/chaeulso/baileys, commit 64521ae), both MIT licensed.

